# Relations this migration declares; probed by db-schema/tests/schema_fence.rs.
#
# `instrument_liveness` is deliberately absent: 0010 replaces its body with
# `CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW`, which leaves it a view, so `0009_instruments.fence`'s
# declaration of it stays valid and covers it. Re-declaring it here would claim
# this migration creates it, which it does not.
#
# The `COMMENT ON TABLE` statements on `feed_health` and `push_health` create no
# relation and so declare nothing.
view instrument_source_liveness
